# SagaBench/results — PUBLIC repo .gitignore (allowlist principle)
# Ignore EVERYTHING by default, then un-ignore only the explicitly-public files.
# This makes it structurally impossible to accidentally push a moat file
# (engine internals, world-generator, screening, holdout seeds) or internal notes.

# 1) ignore everything
/*
/**

# 2) un-ignore the public surface
!README.md
!VERIFYING.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-ENGINE
!MANIFEST.json
!.gitignore

!data/
!data/**
!replays/
!replays/**

# 3) HARD block internal/moat patterns even if copied in by mistake
GATED-DECISIONS.md
**/GATED-DECISIONS.md
*secret*
*SECRET*
*holdout*
*pepper*
*COMMIT_PEPPER*
*.pem
*.key
keys/
**/keys/**
emergence-engine-*.js
saga-seed-registry*
sealed-seeds*
# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
node_modules/
